{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想將錄音或影片中的講話內容整理成可閱讀的文字？Video Transcriber 主打無須註冊、不上傳檔案的私密轉錄體驗，適合學生、創作者、專業人士與研究人員處理會議、課堂、訪談與播客等素材。原價 US $0.99，現於 App Store 限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>免註冊的私密轉錄體驗</h2>\n<p>Video Transcriber 可直接匯入音訊或影片檔案，將講話內容轉換成可閱讀的文字，方便檢視、編輯、儲存及分享。介面簡潔專注，適合會議記錄、課堂重溫、訪談整理、播客筆記與語音備忘，亦方便學生、創作者、專業人士與研究人員使用。轉錄結果可匯出作筆記或內容創作之用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-480-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-481-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-482-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-483-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-484-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-485-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Video Transcriber – Transcript</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T01:29:21.236496+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":341,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}